{"id":"36007dd923c0c8f8","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-nw-design-existence.md","title":"组合设计的贪心存在性","display":"lem-nw-design-existence — 组合设计的贪心存在性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-nw-design-existence","aliases":["28-lem-nw-design-existence"],"display":"lem-nw-design-existence — 组合设计的贪心存在性","depends_on":["[[28-df-nw-design]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.14","source_printed_pages":"411–413","source_pdf_pages":"437–439","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-nw-design-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-nw-design-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-nw-design-existence — 组合设计的贪心存在性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" href=\"?note=7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" title=\"28-df-nw-design\">28-df-nw-design</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 20.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"411–413"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"437–439"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,n,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell,n,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;d\">\\(n&gt;d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&gt;10n^2/d\">\\(\\ell&gt;10n^2/d\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor\">\\(m=\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}\">\\(\\operatorname{NWDesigns}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" href=\"?note=7d58f8e24dbfba2e\" title=\"28-df-nw-design\">28-df-nw-design</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明采用不依赖小参数 Chernoff 常数的计数论证。贪心已选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;m\">\\(k&lt;m\\)</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元集时，均匀选一个新的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq[\\ell]\">\\(I\\subseteq[\\ell]\\)</span>。对固定旧集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1\">\\(|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1\\)</span>，则包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d+1)\">\\((d+1)\\)</span> 元子集。并界与无放回抽样给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1]\\le\\binom n{d+1}\\left(\\frac n\\ell\\right)^{d+1}\\le\\left(\\frac{en^2}{(d+1)\\ell}\\right)^{d+1}&lt;\\left(\\frac e{10}\\right)^{d+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1]\\le\\binom n{d+1}\\left(\\frac n\\ell\\right)^{d+1}\\le\\left(\\frac{en^2}{(d+1)\\ell}\\right)^{d+1}&lt;\\left(\\frac e{10}\\right)^{d+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此任一旧集造成冲突的总概率小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{d/10}(e/10)^{d+1}&lt;1\">\\(2^{d/10}(e/10)^{d+1}&lt;1\\)</span>，对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\ge1\">\\(d\\ge1\\)</span> 成立。至少一个候选满足每个交集至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，贪心可以继续到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&gt;n\">\\(\\ell&gt;n\\)</span> 由数值前提自动推出。\n按有限子集的字典序搜索即可确定性实现该存在证明。至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 次搜索、每次至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\ell\">\\(2^\\ell\\)</span> 个候选并作有限集合比较，时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(\\ell)}\">\\(2^{O(\\ell)}\\)</span>；本 Assertion 只声明存在性，不把输出编码和运行时间作为未定义的算法谓词。\n来源注意：印刷 p.412 / PDF p.438 的汇总段改写了 Lemma 20.14 的集合数；本节点保留原引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor\">\\(\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor\\)</span>，舍弃该汇总段不一致的参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nw-design","status":"resolved","id":"7d58f8e24dbfba2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nw-design]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nw-design","status":"resolved","id":"7d58f8e24dbfba2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ell,n,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$n>d$，$\\ell>10n^2/d$；$m=\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor$。$\\operatorname{NWDesigns}$ 见 [[28-df-nw-design]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\ell,n,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n>d","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell>10n^2/d","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NWDesigns}_{\\ell,n,d,\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"k<m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq[\\ell]","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"(d+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[|I\\cap J|\\ge d+1]\\le\\binom n{d+1}\\left(\\frac n\\ell\\right)^{d+1}\\le\\left(\\frac{en^2}{(d+1)\\ell}\\right)^{d+1}<\\left(\\frac e{10}\\right)^{d+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{d/10}(e/10)^{d+1}<1","display":false},{"tex":"d\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell>n","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"2^{O(\\ell)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lfloor2^{d/10}\\rfloor","display":false}],"bytes":2105,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":["7d58f8e24dbfba2e"]}